WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Open a presentation and review the current slide with its speaker notes.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Swipe through the deck while the notes stay synchronized with each slide.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Rotate the iPhone and continue browsing in landscape.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Collapse or reopen the notes panel without leaving the presentation.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.833
Tap Play to hear the current slide's notes.
